message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "CumulativeCorr"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Seo"
    given-names: "Myung-Jun"
    email: "mseo2@crimson.ua.edu"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23334955"
repository-code: "https://github.com/joshuaseo0123/CumulativeCorr"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  CumulativeCorr is a Streamlit-based application for cumulative
  Pearson and Spearman correlation analysis of paired delta13C and delta18O
  data through a stratigraphic section, with downward and upward cumulative
  analysis modes.
keywords:
  - stable isotopes
  - carbon isotopes
  - oxygen isotopes
  - stratigraphy
  - correlation analysis
  - Pearson correlation
  - Spearman correlation
